# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，检出也用 LF。
# 跨平台项目（Windows / Linux 一等公民）没有这条，Windows 贡献者提交的 CRLF 会让
# 整个文件在 diff 里显示为全量改动，review 时直接失效。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：禁止任何换行转换与差异计算
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.avi binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.AppImage binary
*.deb binary
